{"steam_appid":1752060,"steam_name":"Wild Dogs","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1752060/404846/11e871d6c2688e44a616f737dc6a22e24ed55a7f/1751027217/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1632851288","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256853476/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1632851288","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/ss_45dded1fe5d016be8ef9dcfd3d3cc43cb81d9bf6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1681988459","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/ss_e3294996ad5d8535082f4c22250c4799228542c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1681988459","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/ss_e661281dddd0bcaca1e051de5e1692a9146a3ac2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1681988459","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/ss_2bac82b703507af06efc6b1f4fa8de421822251c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1681988459","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/ss_349fc81cbde3355d03ff1511aa568e1e7b9b0f76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1681988459"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/82c0dba4df52041ba4aad28d64db7603.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><br>In Wild Dogs the world is under a frantic alien attack. Amidst the chaos and with the army virtually subdued, the deadliest and most inconsequential pair of specialists are called upon to do what must be done.<br>Join the war hunting aliens around the world and in every way possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/c1013c92d60804f1ecf6626a72f58368.poster.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/c1013c92d60804f1ecf6626a72f58368.webm?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/c1013c92d60804f1ecf6626a72f58368.mp4?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/037a731c0f72c81c1d10fc341fce620d.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><br>A few days before the &quot;Biolab Wars&quot; protocol is activated by the army, Major Frank &quot;Pumpkinhead&quot; Williams and his partner Teddy are summoned to the front lines.<br>Authorized to use all necessary methods, the pair will explode, run over, crush and smear themselves in a lot of alien goo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/af47abcbef2102688234b4eec6853b70.poster.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/af47abcbef2102688234b4eec6853b70.webm?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/af47abcbef2102688234b4eec6853b70.mp4?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/fccd507672c602a9d4c79183e20d5d8e.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Major Frank &quot;Pumpkinhead&quot; Williams:</strong> A man of few words and lots of action. Weapons specialist and natural pilot. He speaks more than 42 languages just mumbling.<br></li><li><strong>Teddy:</strong> A cheerful Labrador and stealth expert. A legend in the Wild Dogs kennel.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/edff4edfe06ece5e5039c233c8af95a8.poster.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/edff4edfe06ece5e5039c233c8af95a8.webm?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/edff4edfe06ece5e5039c233c8af95a8.mp4?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/80abb5f70e732bc48bb271d46e4e4896.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><br>Blast through 5 scenes full of aliens. Use all available resources such as motorcycles, cars, helicopters and others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/862f8bfb045ce49f403c6cc06a7f416f.poster.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/862f8bfb045ce49f403c6cc06a7f416f.webm?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/862f8bfb045ce49f403c6cc06a7f416f.mp4?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/1f5a3a1ccef8238c245fb590d54a15c6.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D platformer with classic and varied mechanics;<br></li><li>Shoot in 8 directions;<br></li><li>Pilot planes, mecha and everything that is within your reach;<br></li><li>Most bizarre and varied boss fights;<br></li><li>Rain bullets with varied and powerful shots;<br></li><li>Switch between multiple color palettes.</li></ul><br><strong>Whether human or dog, it's time to shoot!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/137b0476816026fcd1763686cdc25f27.poster.avif?t=1681988459\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/137b0476816026fcd1763686cdc25f27.webm?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752060/extras/137b0476816026fcd1763686cdc25f27.mp4?t=1681988459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 212 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 212 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["2ndBoss"],"publishers":["2ndBoss"],"release_date":"20 Apr, 2023"}